{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽の三姉妹。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/06/04/7224470/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１６人のプリンシパル deux"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演終了！東京も合わせて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20公演終了しましたー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪では立候補した役 全て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入ることができました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・いつみ・ひさこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・沢村   ・ひさこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてななせ、若月が10役制覇。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんが8役制覇。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて私が 7役制覇。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Σ（・□・；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10役全て覚えなければならないという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のコンセプトの中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10役はできなかったものの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7役をやりきることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ひさこ、ふさこ、いつみ、洋子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北島、明田川、沢村)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できるだけ多くの役に挑戦する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というのは最初の目標でしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはきちんとその役を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中で作りあげてきてから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と決めていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢村くんは密かにずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりたかった役で、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで色んなメンバーが演じる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢村くんを見て それも踏まえて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽に挑戦しました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の演じる沢村、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか1番気になります。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に長い闘いでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一幕の二回目のアドリブ審査では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷静さと瞬発力"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなお題にも動じない姿勢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き出しの多さ、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことが一気に求められました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ローズ・ドＳ・パープル先生こと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江本さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとメンバー一人ひとりの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個性や 長所や得意なことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かってくださっていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その厳しいお題にも愛を感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は全然できなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分も含めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれに対応できるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なっていって、それが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドリブ力。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タレントにはどのジャンルでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"求められることだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回かなり鍛えられたと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーン・シャドー先生こと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柿丸さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、明るくて面白くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏でもギリギリまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスをしてくださいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江本さん、柿丸さんには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台に立つとはどういうことか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演劇が初めてな私達に何から何まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一から教えて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は またぜひ江本さんの元で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台をやりたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとの絆も深まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと歩んできた道のりは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何にも変え難いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結成されてからずっと一緒に居て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもまだ知らなかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの新たな一面を見れた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの存在が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を強くしてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京も大阪も楽屋で隣の席で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はたくさん支えられたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/06/04/7224470/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衛藤いつみと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上誠一。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、かっこよかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもこの仲間となら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなことも乗り越えていける"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と確信できました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのことが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このプリンシパルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力の跡が形となって結果に出た。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大好きな公演になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー終わってしまったんやなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で悩んで本気でもがいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で逃げたくて本気で苦しんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で泣いて本気で笑って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で助け合って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で、駆け抜けた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気でやり遂げたあとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに気持ちいいんだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わったことに対して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホッとしているけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心に穴が空いたように寂しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか抜け殻みたい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉で言い表せない、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで生きてきた中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな気持ちは初めてです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみなさんにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長していく姿をしっかりと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てもらえたかな、って思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またプリンシパルを見たい！と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってもらいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演をやり遂げたことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達の誇りだし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演こそが乃木坂46です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共に助け合いながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"闘ってきたメンバー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関わってくださった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフのみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木坂familyのみなさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れ様でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16人のプリンシパル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/06/04/7224470/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台本。我が親友よ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボロボロの君は 一生の宝物(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年6月3日    衛藤美彩。"}],"source":"archive"}